#: ../../source/concepts.md:64
msgid "Centaur Body (New in v1.3)"
msgstr "Corps centaure (Nouveau dans v1.3)"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:66
msgid ""
"**Chiron** ⚷ (body_id=13): Centaur body between Saturn and Uranus. "
"Computed via embedded Chebyshev polynomial coefficients; valid range "
"**1900–2100** (expanded in v1.4). Out-of-range input is silently clamped "
"to the nearest segment boundary. See [Chiron](chiron.md) for details."
msgstr ""
"**Chiron** ⚷ (body_id=13) : Corps centaure entre Saturne et Uranus. "
"Calculé via des coefficients de polynômes de Chebyshev embarqués ; plage "
"valide **1900–2100** (étendue en v1.4). Toute entrée hors plage est "
"silencieusement clampée à la limite de segment la plus proche. Voir "
"[Chiron](chiron.md) pour les détails."

#: ../../source/concepts.md ../../source/concepts.md:68
msgid "Aspects"
msgstr "Aspects"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:70
msgid "Harmonic Theory"
msgstr "Théorie des harmoniques"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:72
msgid ""
"Aspects lean on the geometry of the zodiac circle. A **harmonic** divides"
" a base angle into *n* equal parts, and the resulting fractions act as "
"landmarks for the main kinds of planetary encounters."
msgstr ""
"Les aspects reposent sur la géométrie du cercle du zodiaque. Un "
"**harmonique** divise un angle de base en *n* parties égales, et les "
"fractions résultantes servent de repères pour les principaux types de "
"rencontres planétaires."

#: ../../source/concepts.md:74
msgid ""
"The default framing uses the **half-circle base** (180°, the distance "
"between conjunction and opposition): harmonics **1, 2, 3, 6** yield the 7"
" classical-to-Ptolemaic aspects (Conjunction, Semi-sextile, Sextile, "
"Square, Trine, Quincunx, Opposition). This is the TRADITIONAL preset, the"
" library default."
msgstr ""
"Le cadrage par défaut utilise la **base demi-cercle** (180°, la distance "
"entre la conjonction et l'opposition) : les harmoniques **1, 2, 3, 6** "
"produisent les 7 aspects classiques-ptolémaïques (Conjonction, Semi-"
"sextile, Sextile, Carré, Trigone, Quinconce, Opposition). C'est le preset"
" TRADITIONAL, la valeur par défaut de la bibliothèque."

#: ../../source/concepts.md:76
msgid ""
"**Full-circle harmonics** (5, 9, 10 — quintiles, noviles, deciles) use a "
"360° base and are available as opt-in presets; they are not part of the "
"default set."
msgstr ""
"Les **harmoniques plein-cercle** (5, 9, 10 — quintiles, noviles, déciles)"
" utilisent une base de 360° et sont disponibles comme presets opt-in ; "
"ils ne font pas partie de l'ensemble par défaut."

#: ../../source/concepts.md:78
msgid "Harmonic 1 (180°/1 = 180°)"
msgstr "Harmonique 1 (180°/1 = 180°)"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:80
msgid "Conjunction (0°): same point"
msgstr "Conjonction (0°) : même point"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:81
msgid "Opposition (180°): opposite point"
msgstr "Opposition (180°) : point opposé"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:83
msgid "Harmonic 2 (180°/2 = 90°)"
msgstr "Harmonique 2 (180°/2 = 90°)"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:85
msgid "Square (90°): quarter circle"
msgstr "Carré (90°) : quart de cercle"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:87
msgid "Harmonic 3 (180°/3 = 60°)"
msgstr "Harmonique 3 (180°/3 = 60°)"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:89
msgid "Sextile (60°): 1/3 of semi-circle"
msgstr "Sextile (60°) : 1/3 du demi-cercle"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:90
msgid "Trine (120°): 2/3 of semi-circle"
msgstr "Trigone (120°) : 2/3 du demi-cercle"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:92
msgid "Harmonic 6 (180°/6 = 30°)"
msgstr "Harmonique 6 (180°/6 = 30°)"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:94
msgid "Semi-sextile (30°): 1/6 of semi-circle"
msgstr "Semi-sextile (30°) : 1/6 du demi-cercle"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:95
msgid "Quincunx (150°): 5/6 of semi-circle"
msgstr "Quinconce (150°) : 5/6 du demi-cercle"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:97
msgid ""
"The full-circle minor harmonics — **H5** (quintiles), **H9** (noviles), "
"**H10** (deciles) — are **available in code** but are not part of the "
"default framing. They are opt-in via the `EXTENDED` preset or "
"`aspects_for_harmonics([5, 9, 10])` (see [Configurable Aspect Sets"
"](#configurable-aspect-sets-new-in-v1-1-updated-in-v1-3) below)."
msgstr ""
"Les harmoniques mineurs plein-cercle — **H5** (quintiles), **H9** "
"(noviles), **H10** (déciles) — sont **disponibles dans le code** mais ne "
"font pas partie du cadrage par défaut. Ils sont opt-in via le preset "
"`EXTENDED` ou `aspects_for_harmonics([5, 9, 10])` (voir [Ensembles "
"d'aspects configurables](#configurable-aspect-sets-new-in-v1-1-updated-"
"in-v1-3) ci-dessous)."

